ttps://www.v2ex.com/t/1229695", "created": 1784945919, "deleted": 0, "content": "又菜又慢，有没有懂的，还不如 composer 2.5 。", "content_rendered": "<p>又菜又慢，有没有懂的，还不如 composer 2.5 。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1784945919, "replies": 30, "id": 1229695}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 72262, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9733, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 469106, "username": "cby0414", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/cby0414", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a39fdbb7a2db9dda47beac31ab5113ba?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a39fdbb7a2db9dda47beac31ab5113ba?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a39fdbb7a2db9dda47beac31ab5113ba?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1581586098, "last_modified": 1581586098, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "lookenghua", "last_touched": 1784974697, "title": "已经在中转花了 1000 多块了，找个号池渠道自用可不可行？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1229686", "created": 1784942137, "deleted": 0, "content": "![]( https://i.imgant.com/v2/FJrhkUB.png)\r\n\r\n每天用的 token 少则 5 、6 亿多则将近 20 亿，不知道是不是只有中转、号池这种模式能支撑的了我这种用法（不用考虑 N 小时限量）😂。\r\n\r\n本着能节约一点是一点的想法，我这种是不是直接找号池渠道上游更划算点，反正就我自己用，不用自己维护号池的同时也不用再被中间商再收一次费。\r\n\r\n有没有懂行的 V 友指点一下。", "content_rendered": "<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgant.com/v2/FJrhkUB.png\"/></p>\n<p>每天用的 token 少则 5 、6 亿多则将近 20 亿，不知道是不是只有中转、号池这种模式能支撑的了我这种用法（不用考虑 N 小时限量）😂。</p>\n<p>本着能节约一点是一点的想法，我这种是不是直接找号池渠道上游更划算点，反正就我自己用，不用自己维护号池的同时也不用再被中间商再收一次费。</p>\n<p>有没有懂行的 V 友指点一下。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1784942137, "replies": 25, "id": 1229686}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_large.png?m=1751736785", "name": "openai", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_normal.png?m=1751736785", "title": "OpenAI", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai", "topics": 4358, "footer": "", "header": "关于 OpenAI 旗下产品 GPT，DALL·E，和 ChatGPT 的讨论。请不要在 V2EX 的回复中粘贴复制来自 AI 生成的文本。", "title_alternative": "OpenAI", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785", "stars": 3247, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1135, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 66049, "username": "timwu", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/timwu", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1dfa/9eb2/66049_mini.png?m=1782053649", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1dfa/9eb2/66049_normal.png?m=1782053649", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1dfa/9eb2/66049_large.png?m=1782053649", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1dfa/9eb2/66049_xlarge.png?m=1782053649", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1dfa/9eb2/66049_xxlarge.png?m=1782053649", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1dfa/9eb2/66049_xxxlarge.png?m=1782053649", "created": 1403599027, "last_modified": 1782053649, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "RikkaFlame", "last_touched": 1784971061, "title": "GPT 5.6 Pro 自动降智？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1229703", "created": 1784948280, "deleted": 0, "content": "平常用 Codex 和 ChatGPT 比较多，Codex 因为有用量限制，所以基本只会用到 xhigh 和 high ，偶尔开一下 max 。\r\n\r\nChatGPT 一般无脑开 GPT 5.6 Pro ，直到昨天发现秒答，觉得不对劲，于是问了一下 juice 值，发现 Pro 只有 18 ，明显是被降智并路由到了最差的那一档\r\n![]( https://i.imgur.com/mGXmlqe.png) \r\n\r\n又切成 xhigh 问了一下，发现思考时间变长，juice 值也是正常的 ![]( https://i.imgur.com/EU5cDpS.png)\r\n不得不说这个用户体验是真的不好，如果 Pro 不可用，就直接提示不可用就好了，偷偷路由到最差的模型观感很差", "content_rendered": "<p>平常用 Codex 和 ChatGPT 比较多，Codex 因为有用量限制，所以基本只会用到 xhigh 和 high ，偶尔开一下 max 。</p>\n<p>ChatGPT 一般无脑开 GPT 5.6 Pro ，直到昨天发现秒答，觉得不对劲，于是问了一下 juice 值，发现 Pro 只有 18 ，明显是被降智并路由到了最差的那一档\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mGXmlqe.png\"/> </p>\n<p>又切成 xhigh 问了一下，发现思考时间变长，juice 值也是正常的 <img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EU5cDpS.png\"/>\n不得不说这个用户体验是真的不好，如果 Pro 不可用，就直接提示不可用就好了，偷偷路由到最差的模型观感很差</p>\n", "last_modified": 1784948280, "replies": 25, "id": 1229703}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/b6d7/67d2/22_large.png?m=1649080598", "name": "macos", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/b6d7/67d2/22_normal.png?m=1649080598", "title": "macOS", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/macos", "topics": 23953, "footer": "<a href=\"/mbp\">MacBook Pro</a> 及 <a href=\"/go/imac\">iMac</a> 等 <a href=\"/go/apple\">Apple</a> 公司设计的计算机所运行的操作系统。<a href=\"/go/idev\">iOS</a> 的基础。", "header": "The world’s most advanced desktop operating system.", "title_alternative": "macOS", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/b6d7/67d2/22_mini.png?m=1649080598", "stars": 5490, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 22, "parent_node_name": "os"}, "member": {"id": 706699, "username": "inviteassign", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/inviteassign", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a208/fe38/706699_mini.png?m=1726125589", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a208/fe38/706699_normal.png?m=1726125589", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a208/fe38/706699_large.png?m=1726125589", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a208/fe38/706699_xlarge.png?m=1726125589", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a208/fe38/706699_xxlarge.png?m=1726125589", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a208/fe38/706699_xxxlarge.png?m=1726125589", "created": 1724147888, "last_modified": 1726125589, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "WestRiverClub", "last_touched": 1784942004, "title": "我的 macOS 27 b4 输入法出问题了", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1229637", "created": 1784892692, "deleted": 0, "content": "1. Shift 不能切换中/英\r\n2. 手动输入汉字后，按一下 Shift 没有反应\r\n\r\n\r\n有遇到同样问题的兄弟吗！", "content_rendered": "<ol>\n<li>Shift 不能切换中/英</li>\n<li>手动输入汉字后，按一下 Shift 没有反应</li>\n</ol>\n<p>有遇到同样问题的兄弟吗！</p>\n", "last_modified": 1784892692, "replies": 19, "id": 1229637}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 240185, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4503, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 317324, "username": "rpish", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/rpish", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/713c/b677/317324_mini.png?m=1778243617", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/713c/b677/317324_normal.png?m=1778243617", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/713c/b677/317324_large.png?m=1778243617", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/713c/b677/317324_xlarge.png?m=1778243617", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/713c/b677/317324_xxlarge.png?m=1778243617", "created": 1526717952, "last_modified": 1778243617, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "bsun", "last_touched": 1784601016, "title": "技术已死？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1229704", "created": 1784948319, "deleted": 0, "content": "发现以往技术讨论热度高的社区，V2 ，掘金，Hacker News 全都被 AI 刷榜了。\r\n没有人再关心有什么新产品，新技术。\r\n大家的关注点全在又发布了什么新模型，AI 又做了什么。\r\n\r\n很多人也越来越多地把 coding 交给 AI 来做，不在乎技术细节。\r\n不禁感慨，AI 是否已经跨过了奇点，杀死了技术？", "content_rendered": "<p>发现以往技术讨论热度高的社区，V2 ，掘金，Hacker News 全都被 AI 刷榜了。\n没有人再关心有什么新产品，新技术。\n大家的关注点全在又发布了什么新模型，AI 又做了什么。</p>\n<p>很多人也越来越多地把 coding 交给 AI 来做，不在乎技术细节。\n不禁感慨，AI 是否已经跨过了奇点，杀死了技术？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1784948319, "replies": 19, "id": 1229704}]